 This install applies to "Lin Wu's Challenge" © 1990 Lasersoft.

 This install requires WHDLoad and RawDIC to be in the path. Both can be found
 in the WHDLoad package.
 To install from a different drive than DF0: select installation mode Expert.

 The installed program requires 0.5 MB ChipMem.
 It can be quit by pressing F10 (key can be changed with Tooltype "QuitKey=").

 The releases with password system ask for a password at the start of the game.
 Every opponent plays three games, a password is shown for the first game only:

   Nr  Opponent       Country     Lvl  Password
