 The second and third game of an opponent have their own passwords, but they
 are never displayed by the game.

 If you have problems with this installation please try and get a newer
 version of this package from the WHDLoad WWW-Page. If that doesn't help try
 some Tooltypes like NOCACHE, NOAUTOVEC, NOVBRMOVE, NOMMU, PAL or NTSC. If
 that also fails, please inform the author via the Bug-Report-Form which
 can be accessed on the WHDLoad WWW-Page.

 For the full WHDLoad package, other installs and updates refer to:
	http://www.whdload.org/
 or	aminet:dev/misc/whdload#?
 and	aminet:game/patch/

 version 1.0 (15.09.26) done by Wepl:
 - initial release
 - supports the original release with disk protection and a later release
   with password system
 - disk protection removed
 - keyboard handling fixed (keys were skipped or stuck on fast machines)
 - highscores are saved
 - trainer added, the time limit can be doubled (Custom1) or disabled
   (Custom2), no highscores will be saved when a trainer is used
 - files can be compressed with a WHDLoad supported packer, but most files
   are already PowerPacker compressed
 - source available: https://github.com/wepl/winstalls
 - thanks to nujack for the disk images and testing

 version 1.1 (19.09.26) done by Wepl:
 - support for the english release added

